([Sidenote: Business a contest of wits]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is an era of the greatest commercial activity the world has ever) Tj T*
(known. The development of business is one of the marvels of the new) Tj T*
(century. A few years ago science, as a factor in commerce, was little) Tj T*
(known and less appreciated. The amazing advantages to business of) Tj T*
(intellectual attainments were utterly without recognition. Today,) Tj T*
(however, business has become a contest in which the quickest) Tj T*
(perception wins, thus transforming the counting room into a battle) Tj T*
(ground upon which brain matches brain for supremacy and success.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Success-educated enthusiasm]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Ah, that enchanting word, S-U-C-C-E-S-S. It does not require a magic) Tj T*
(key to unlock the door to business efficiency. There is nothing) Tj T*
(mystic, nothing mysterious in the applied method of the really) Tj T*
(resourceful men in this day of great successes, of marvelous) Tj T*
(achievements in business enterprise. The sum total is contained in two) Tj T*
(words, words that electrify, nevertheless. EDUCATED ENTHUSIASM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Changing conditions make opportunities]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The most formidable barrier to progress has always been the senseless) Tj T*
(opposition of those to whom it would be of the greatest benefit.) Tj T*
(Changing conditions are the order of the day, for enlightenment has) Tj T*
(worked wonders. In olden times, a man of affairs was obliged to guard) Tj T*
(his property and his loved ones by building a moat around his house) Tj T*
(and posting sentinels in and around his estate. The time is not long) Tj T*
(past when, because of prejudice, perversity or ignorance, many men) Tj T*
(believed that opportunity knocked only once at any man?s door. Today,) Tj T*
(thanks to deeper insight, most men believe that life itself is) Tj T*
(opportunity; that the very air we breathe is opportunity; that each) Tj T*
(new day presents broader opportunities for accomplishing more because) Tj T*
(of better directed energy. This is not alone the accepted dogma of the) Tj T*
(man who is making his way in the world. It is the creed, doctrine,) Tj T*
(tenet or religion, whichever you may care to term it, of the great) Tj T*
(captains of industry everywhere.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: New ideas count]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The more successful the man, the more does he think, study, plan, as a) Tj T*
(part of his daily occupation in the development of the affairs in) Tj T*
(which he is interested. Newer and better ways to get things done is) Tj T*
(the business standard employed today by successful men in all lines.) Tj T*
(Only yesterday if a man of genius advanced a new idea, he found) Tj T*
(himself ridiculed and his innovation opposed on all sides because it) Tj T*
(was a new idea. Today, it is different. The man of ideas counts in the) Tj T*
(trend of affairs as he has never counted before.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Must keep step with changing times]) Tj T*
