([Sidenote: Basis of all business success]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One of the great objects set forth in this Business Administration) Tj T*
(series is to supply the positive energy which begets courage,) Tj T*
(confidence, initiative and success. We want to make you feel the) Tj T*
(necessity of doing some reading, a little plain thinking, and to make) Tj T*
(as clear as possible the important things that are involved in the) Tj T*
(serious but very fine game of business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(With business becoming with each succeeding day more and more of a) Tj T*
(science, it is high time to understand what is essential to it.) Tj T*
(Speaking of the subject of ?Organized Business,? a great authority) Tj T*
(recently said, ?It is time even for business men to understand) Tj T*
(business.? Again, the purpose of this course in Business) Tj T*
(Administration is, if possible, to measure the power and principles of) Tj T*
(business, to trace their ramifications, define their elements, get) Tj T*
(hold of their vital fundamentals, and so comprehend them, both in) Tj T*
(technical detail and as a mighty unit. And I am confident we have done) Tj T*
(all this. I find that at the foundation, the machinery of business is) Tj T*
(simple, but whether it is plain or complicated, all who would succeed) Tj T*
(must make every effort to comprehend it thoroughly. All I care to) Tj T*
(emphasize at present is the great truth that knowledge, established) Tj T*
(and classified, is the basis of all business success. This is clearly) Tj T*
(established in this course of reading, and I am trying to incite your) Tj T*
(imagination in writing of its merits just as I would endeavor to) Tj T*
(enable you to realize it if I could talk to you personally right) Tj T*
(across my desk. The observant man can see clearly the things I am) Tj T*
(talking about, but to most men the mind?s eye perceives not by) Tj T*
(observation, but only when the imagination is stimulated. So I would) Tj T*
(stir all men to look earnestly into these things, with a view to their) Tj T*
(personal betterment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Business axioms simple to understand]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Business is far more than business as it is commonly understood. It is) Tj T*
(a science, and it is the eager, practical minds of business men that) Tj T*
(we shall endeavor to convince first of that fact, and our reasons for) Tj T*
(addressing those principally concerned are especially good. Why? I) Tj T*
(have found that in writing about business whenever I was able to make) Tj T*
(the principles so plain that business men understood them, everybody) Tj T*
(else did, so it is to be expected that if business axioms can be made) Tj T*
(simple enough for business men to understand them, everyone will) Tj T*
(apprehend them. Everybody. And it is everybody that we are attempting) Tj T*
(to reach.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Sidenote: Knowledge is power]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For nearly thirty centuries men have recognized the concrete wisdom of) Tj T*
(Solomon?s proverb: ?A wise man is strong; yea, a man of knowledge) Tj T*
