(INTRODUCTION.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the preparation of this text the author has endeavored to apply the) Tj T*
(principles of economic science to some of the more important problems) Tj T*
(of the modern industrial world, and especially those now confronting) Tj T*
(the people of the United States. He has attempted in doing this above) Tj T*
(all to make the text practical. The student or teacher of economics) Tj T*
