(corresponding with the traditional divisions of economic text-books) Tj T*
(into production and distribution \(land, capital and organization, and) Tj T*
(labor\), consumption, exchange, and the relation of the government to) Tj T*
(the individual. It is hoped that the text may not be without profit) Tj T*
(and interest to the general reader as well as the students of the La) Tj T*
(Salle Extension University.) Tj T*
