(maximum of freedom the welfare of society will at the same time be) Tj T*
(best promoted. Consequently, in our modern industrial society, a man) Tj T*
(is given not only social and religious liberty, but is free to move,) Tj T*
(to choose his occupation, to produce and to trade, to associate with) Tj T*
(his fellows, and to expend his income as he will. But here again,) Tj T*
