() Tj T*
(The term ?industrial society? has already been frequently used and) Tj T*
(needs a somewhat fuller explanation. About the year 1760 there took) Tj T*
(place in England what is usually called the Industrial Revolution. A) Tj T*
(number of inventions were made which rendered it possible to use           6) Tj T*
(steam-driven machinery in the manufacture, first of textile and then) Tj T*
(of other goods. Manufactures were removed from the home, where they) Tj T*
(had hitherto been carried on, to the factory. Capital began to be used) Tj T*
(in large masses, machinery displaced hand tools, and the laborer) Tj T*
(ceased to own the implements with which he worked. Men, machines, and) Tj T*
(capital were massed in the factory and organized under the management) Tj T*
(of a new set of industrial organizers for the purpose of producing) Tj T*
(goods for a world market. The development of such an industrial) Tj T*
(society has been attended by the minute division of labor, by a) Tj T*
(growing separation of classes, by concentration of the population in) Tj T*
(urban centers, by the increasing cost and complexity of machinery, by) Tj T*
(the development of improved methods of transportation and of credit,) Tj T*
(by the combination of labor and of capital, by the enormous increase) Tj T*
(of production, and by the growing concentration of wealth.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The introduction of power manufacture completely revolutionized) Tj T*
(industry. The independent workman with his own tools was superseded by) Tj T*
(the factory, the small producer has given way in turn to the trust.) Tj T*
(With the introduction of expensive machinery it became necessary to) Tj T*
(organize capital on a large scale. Corporations with limited liability) Tj T*
(were organized for the manufacture of goods, the exploitation of) Tj T*
(mines, the building of railroads, and the carrying on of trade. As) Tj T*
(methods of production improved industry became more and more) Tj T*
(concentrated, and finally huge trusts took over the operation of) Tj T*
(combined plants. The business unit has grown increasingly larger, and) Tj T*
(the need and power of capital have become increasingly important.) Tj T*
(Capital has played a role of growing significance and has become more) Tj T*
(and more powerful in modern economic life. Indeed the name) Tj T*
(?capitalistic production? has been applied to modern industry because) Tj T*
(of the predominant importance of capital in all lines of wealth            7) Tj T*
(production. Impersonal, growing by sheer force of its own momentum,) Tj T*
(capital is often thought of as intensely selfish and even cruel.) Tj T*
(Abuses which have arisen in the development of modern capitalistic) Tj T*
(industry must be remedied, but attacks upon capital itself are) Tj T*
(misguided and rest upon a mistaken analysis of methods of production.) Tj T*
