(We have already seen how production upon a large scale has superseded) Tj T*
(production upon a small scale in most important branches of) Tj T*
(manufactures. We have now to inquire whether production upon a large) Tj T*
(scale is in turn to be supplanted by single consolidated enterprises,) Tj T*
(by those combinations of capital known as trusts. Under one of these) Tj T*
(three conditions industry must be carried on; few people wish to) Tj T*
(revert to the stage when production was carried on in small) Tj T*
(establishments, but warm controversy and difference of opinion still) Tj T*
(exist as to whether centralized management by a single company or) Tj T*
(combination offers superior advantages to production by independent) Tj T*
(competing establishments. The concentration of production in a few) Tj T*
(large establishments has been followed by the consolidation of these) Tj T*
(larger units into a single whole. Since the days of Adam Smith capital) Tj T*
(has tended to combine for the purpose of fixing prices, and these         40) Tj T*
(combinations have passed through several phases. The earliest form is) Tj T*
(the agreement of independent concerns to fix prices, as was done by) Tj T*
(the American railroads in their early traffic agreements. The next) Tj T*
(step was to divide the field, as has been done by the French railways) Tj T*
(and the American express companies. A third phase of combination was) Tj T*
(the pool, which attempted to regulate the output rather than to fix) Tj T*
(the price or divide the field. Railway, whisky, beam, and other pools) Tj T*
(were organized for this purpose, but all broke down because of the) Tj T*
(difficulty of enforcing the agreement and the temptations to each) Tj T*
(member to break it secretly for the sake of the large profits) Tj T*
(obtainable. By this time it had become clear that if a real permanent) Tj T*
(consolidation of interests was to be secured by the competing) Tj T*
(enterprises some closer form of combination must be devised which) Tj T*
(could not be broken at will by any member. An industrial union and not) Tj T*
(a loose confederation must be attained. Accordingly the next step was) Tj T*
(taken in 1882 by the formation of the Standard Oil Trust, so called) Tj T*
(because the constituent concerns handed over their business to the) Tj T*
(complete control of a central board of trustees, receiving in return) Tj T*
(trust certificates which entitled them to dividends. Similar ?trusts?) Tj T*
(were formed in the whisky, sugar, and other industries, but were) Tj T*
(speedily declared illegal by the federal Supreme Court. By this) Tj T*
(decision the form of combination was changed, but the movement was not) Tj T*
(at all checked. The next phase and the last was the establishment of) Tj T*
(holding corporations, which are organized to buy up and hold the stock) Tj T*
(of a number of individual corporations, which still retain their) Tj T*
(corporate existence. In this way unity of control is secured, to which) Tj T*
(is added a certain flexibility; but it is really the trust under) Tj T*
(another legal form. Where pooling and combination by means of holding) Tj T*
(companies have been forbidden by law, as in the case of railroad) Tj T*
(companies, actual consolidation has often taken place, though when        41) Tj T*
(trusts are spoken of the other form of combination is more often) Tj T*
