(death, withdrawal, or insolvency of any member. The advantage of the) Tj T*
(corporation lies in the fact that it has a continuous existence, and) Tj T*
(that the liability of the shareholders is limited to the amount of) Tj T*
(capital actually contributed by each; it is well adapted to modern) Tj T*
(enterprise because it permits the summation of large amounts of) Tj T*
(capital from a number of small savers and centralizes the use of this) Tj T*
