(credit. There is at no one time enough money in the country to meet) Tj T*
(all obligations expressed in terms of money. Considerably over) Tj T*
(three-fourths of the larger commercial transactions in the United) Tj T*
(States are carried on by means of credit. If everyone tries at the) Tj T*
(same time to get actual cash, there is simply not enough money in the) Tj T*
(country to go around. This increase of demand and diminution in the) Tj T*
(supply of money forces up the interest rate on short-time loans.) Tj T*
