(group of men direct industry and determine what shall be produced.) Tj T*
(They try to estimate future demand and to adjust production to) Tj T*
(consumption, but they often make mistakes. They divert capital into) Tj T*
(unproductive industries, they produce the wrong things and create a) Tj T*
(comparative glut in certain lines, and when they cannot sell their) Tj T*
(goods at a profitable price they fail and precipitate a crisis.) Tj T*
(Industry must then be reorganized and frequently control be put in the) Tj T*
(hands of other men. A variation has been given this theory by the) Tj T*
(socialists, under the leadership of Rodbertus, who insist that the) Tj T*
