(out that the position of the laborer has been one of increasing) Tj T*
(dependence in the following five important points: \(1\) The ownership) Tj T*
(of material--at first the worker owned this and made it into the) Tj T*
(finished product, but now he has only a passing interest in a small) Tj T*
(part of the process of working it up. \(2\) Ownership of tools--he) Tj T*
(retained these up to the time of the introduction of machinery, but) Tj T*
(now seldom owns them. \(3\) Control of productive power--with the) Tj T*
(displacement of hand labor and muscular power by steam-driven) Tj T*
(machinery, he no longer owns even this. \(4\) Relations between workers) Tj T*
(and employers--they were formerly on an equality; under the guild) Tj T*
(system the master and the apprentice had the same social position; now) Tj T*
(the laborer has sunk in the scale, or the employer has risen, until) Tj T*
(the only bond between them is, as Carlyle said, the ?cash nexus.? A) Tj T*
(case was recently instanced where a workingman who had been working in) Tj T*
(a factory met his employer for the first time at the end of seventeen) Tj T*
(years. \(5\) Workplace--until the establishment of the factory system) Tj T*
(this had always been the home; now it is the factory, and there is a      63) Tj T*
