(More important than the history of labor organizations is a knowledge     71) Tj T*
(of their objects and methods. The primary purpose is of course to) Tj T*
(control the conditions of labor and to substitute the principle of) Tj T*
(collective bargaining for individual contract. As one of the most) Tj T*
(effective ways to secure this result they aim at a more or less) Tj T*
(complete monopoly of the labor market. This they may do by bringing) Tj T*
(all workers in a trade within the union or by preventing non-union men) Tj T*
(from working. The first of these is called the inclusive method,[15]) Tj T*
(and if successful makes the union the sole seller of the kind of labor) Tj T*
(controlled by its members. It is a monopoly of the laborers against) Tj T*
(the employers and is sought to be enforced by inducing men to join the) Tj T*
(union either by persuasion or coercion, the latter finding expression) Tj T*
(in the strikes against the employment of non-union men and the) Tj T*
(insistence upon the ?closed shop.? The other form of monopoly consists) Tj T*
(in the exclusion of new members from the trade and in a control of) Tj T*
(employment; this is a monopoly of a small group against their) Tj T*
(fellow-workmen. It is enforced by regulating the entrance to the) Tj T*
(trade, making it difficult or expensive, or by limiting the number of) Tj T*
(apprentices. Sometimes, as in the Chicago Building Trades in 1900,) Tj T*
(they have united with their employers by means of ?exclusive) Tj T*
(agreements? to raise wages and prices of the finished products at the) Tj T*
(same time, and thus jointly to mulct the public. Such efforts to) Tj T*
(monopolize the labor market have their counterparts in the) Tj T*
(organization of capital, as we have seen. In practice such a labor) Tj T*
(monopoly has sometimes been used to improve and elevate conditions,) Tj T*
(just as sometimes a capitalistic monopoly has reduced prices below the) Tj T*
(competitive point. In general, however, we must condemn monopoly on) Tj T*
(principle in the competitive field and insist that freedom and) Tj T*
(opportunity be given to all on as equal terms as possible. Of the two     72) Tj T*
(forms of trade union monopoly, the former alone, which endeavors to) Tj T*
(make it all comprehensive and to enforce generally union conditions,) Tj T*
(can be economically justified.) Tj T*
