(skilled and efficient workers in organized trades. Finally, strikes) Tj T*
(are given as a cause of unemployment in the table; these are a) Tj T*
(peculiar feature of modern industry, and do not call for further) Tj T*
(discussion, except to point out that they are not as important as) Tj T*
(often represented.) Tj T*
