(So far in the discussion of modern capitalistic production and of the) Tj T*
(various labor problems to which it has given rise we have not treated) Tj T*
(in detail the question of machinery and its effects on labor. We) Tj T*
(cannot, however, leave this subject without taking up this phase of it) Tj T*
(with considerable care. The advantages of machinery have been more) Tj T*
(often emphasized than the evils, so that we may profitably begin with) Tj T*
(the darker side of the picture. President Hadley[28] enumerates three) Tj T*
(evils which are charged against machinery, as now managed and) Tj T*
(operated: ?1. That it displaces a large amount of human labor, thus) Tj T*
(taking income away from employes and giving it to employers. 2. That) Tj T*
(when it does not actually drive human labor out of use, it employs it) Tj T*
(in circumstances unfavorable to efficiency, health, and morals. 3.) Tj T*
(That under the best conditions it deprives the workman of) Tj T*
(independence, making him a specialized machine instead of a) Tj T*
(broad-minded man.? We cannot do better than take up these points one) Tj T*
