(out of employment. The extent to which this will occur depends on the) Tj T*
(suddenness and extensiveness of the change, but fortunately, as) Tj T*
(Professor Nicholson points out, new inventions seldom come suddenly or) Tj T*
(are introduced all at once on an extensive scale. It took almost a) Tj T*
(generation, for example, for American machine methods to displace        102) Tj T*
(Swiss hand labor in the making of watches. But when such a change does) Tj T*
