(the margin of employment, for a man past middle life can rarely learn) Tj T*
(a new trade. The effect of displacement in causing suffering will also) Tj T*
(depend somewhat upon the mobility of labor, both the knowledge of new) Tj T*
(opportunities and the capital to make possible a change of location or) Tj T*
(industry, and improvements in the means of transportation. It can) Tj T*
(easily be shown that as a general principle the lump-of-labor theory) Tj T*
