(the demand is inelastic, that is, will not be expanded by reason of a) Tj T*
(fall in price, as in the case of salt or coffins, then the displaced) Tj T*
(labor will not be reabsorbed in the same industry but must look) Tj T*
(elsewhere for employment.) Tj T*
