() Tj T*
(A third confusion of ideas that exists in the popular mind is due to) Tj T*
(an over-emphasis of the desirability of work for its own sake. The man) Tj T*
(who ?makes work? is thought to be doing a desirable thing, even though) Tj T*
(this results from the unnecessary destruction of useful things. Now) Tj T*
(the real goal of all rational economic endeavor is not production for) Tj T*
(its own sake, but consumption; not work, but the gratification of) Tj T*
(wants. Every destruction of durable commodities which lessens the) Tj T*
(power to gratify wants is a loss to a community and no juggling with) Tj T*
(words can make it anything else. If it gives employment to labor, that) Tj T*
(means that the labor has been diverted from the production of other) Tj T*
(things to which it would have been devoted. Edward Atkinson several) Tj T*
(years ago calculated that every year fires destroyed property in the) Tj T*
(United States to the amount $150,000,000.[45] That workmen are) Tj T*
(employed to reproduce the buildings, etc., can surely not be reckoned) Tj T*
(as a social gain. There is great danger in a commercial age like ours) Tj T*
(of forgetting that work is not an end in itself, but simply a means to) Tj T*
(an end. But it may be argued that unless these men had been given        131) Tj T*
(employment of this sort, they would have starved. It is conceivable) Tj T*
(that during or after a revolution industry would be so interrupted) Tj T*
(that ordinary employments would not be open. But in ordinary times) Tj T*
(such a statement is simply an assertion of the fallacious) Tj T*
(lump-of-labor theory, that there is just so much work to be done and) Tj T*
(no more. New wants are continually pressing for satisfaction, waiting) Tj T*
(only for the prior ones to be satisfied before they urge their claims.) Tj T*
(So soon as the old ones are satisfied, additional employment is) Tj T*
(provided in meeting the newer desires. The aim of society is to expand) Tj T*
(continually the circle of gratified desires. As durable goods and) Tj T*
(agents are accumulated by the process of saving, this becomes) Tj T*
(increasingly possible in every progressive society. Useless) Tj T*
(destruction involves sheer waste and cannot be justified on any) Tj T*
(grounds.) Tj T*
