(But what shall we say about expenditures for luxuries? Here the) Tj T*
(spending is for the gratification of a want, though it may be out of) Tj T*
(proportion to the results. What shall be our attitude to it? This) Tj T*
(question is not so easy to answer as the other. Three different) Tj T*
(schools have given as many answers to the problem of luxury: the first) Tj T*
(condemns it utterly; the second approves it wholly; and the third) Tj T*
