(over 90 per cent of the business. Since they are generally in the form) Tj T*
(of partnerships and not of corporations it has not been possible to) Tj T*
(bring them under legal control, and their rates are extremely) Tj T*
(high--three or four times as much as freight rates. In some cases the) Tj T*
