(public and other securities, and finally to the growth of) Tj T*
(constitutional government, which has made the people willing to) Tj T*
(entrust their capital to a government which they themselves as) Tj T*
(citizens really control.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The question of the tariff involves such important economic as well as) Tj T*
(financial consideration that it seems best to discuss this form of) Tj T*
(taxation somewhat more fully. For it has been used not merely as a) Tj T*
(means of raising revenue but also as an instrument to develop) Tj T*
(particular industries and prevent foreign competition. Any detailed) Tj T*
(discussion of this subject therefore involves a statement of the pros) Tj T*
(and cons of protection and free trade. It should be said, however, in) Tj T*
(advance that the real issue is not free trade, for that is demanded by) Tj T*
(only a few doctrinaires, but freer trade through an intelligent) Tj T*
(revision of the tariff downward. The system of protection has) Tj T*
