(redress of grievances, and the furnishing of utilities, either because) Tj T*
(it could do it better or because it was the only agency capable of) Tj T*
(acting. The standpoint of this treatise has been one of moderate) Tj T*
(individualism, believing in free competition and individual) Tj T*
(initiative, but not frightened off by the bogey of socialism, if at) Tj T*
(any point the interference of government seemed desirable or) Tj T*
