(electricity as the motive power for the newly invented and constantly) Tj T*
(improved machinery has permitted an enormous expansion of production,) Tj T*
(which has been made still greater by the opening up of new mines and) Tj T*
(new lands and improvements in the machinery of transportation and) Tj T*
(exchange and in the organization of business. Especially in the United) Tj T*
(States where the natural resources were especially rich and the people) Tj T*
(energetic and ingenious, has the growth of wealth been marvelous. And) Tj T*
(yet almost a century after the beginning of the Industrial Revolution) Tj T*
(in England, Mill alleged that labor-saving inventions had not) Tj T*
(lightened the toil of any human being; they have only enabled a) Tj T*
(greater number to live the same life of drudgery and imprisonment.) Tj T*
