(entering the agreement for mutual operation and proportionate) Tj T*
(distribution of profits should transfer the shares of their respective) Tj T*
(properties to a new corporation with full powers to manage the same,) Tj T*
(receiving in lieu thereof certificates which should entitle the holder) Tj T*
(to his proportionate share of the net earnings of the new corporation.) Tj T*
