(of any of its immediate applications. But in the industries, it is a) Tj T*
(matter of dollars and cents. The most efficient is the winner. And the) Tj T*
(most efficient is the one who utilizes in his business all the) Tj T*
(scientific information that can be brought to bear on the subject, and) Tj T*
(who is always looking for new facts that can be applied.) Tj T*
