(variety of subjects, while the total amount of its established facts) Tj T*
(is indeed enormous, nevertheless, it must be said with frankness that) Tj T*
(this vastness is made up for the most part by details and more or less) Tj T*
(isolated facts and ideas. Chemistry can boast of remarkable) Tj T*
(achievements. But the greatest achievements are yet before it. And the) Tj T*
(reason is this: Chemistry is not yet a really unified science. The) Tj T*
