(To meet the demand for the concentration of power in large units,        355) Tj T*
(instead of operating a large number of separate installations of small) Tj T*
(power capacity, the pressure producer was devised. This producer) Tj T*
(develops its gas under a slight pressure due to the introduction of an) Tj T*
(air and steam blast, and the gas is stored in a holder until it is) Tj T*
(required by the engine. As the gas may thus be stored before passing) Tj T*
(to the engine, and as its generation does not depend on the suction) Tj T*
(stroke of the engine, tar and other impurities may be removed from it) Tj T*
(by suitable devices, and the use of bituminous coal, lignite, and peat) Tj T*
(thus permitted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The pressure producer was closely followed in the course of) Tj T*
(development by the down-draft producer, which fixes the tar as a) Tj T*
(permanent gas and therefore completely uses the volatile hydrocarbons) Tj T*
(in bituminous coal, lignite, and peat.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
