(remain unmined, a fact which I verified before leaving the plant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The plant is designed for the recovery of the sulphate of ammonia and) Tj T*
(for supplying gas to the neighboring towns for both metallurgical and) Tj T*
(power purposes. As one unit is always held in reserve, the plant is) Tj T*
(called 16,000 horsepower. The main distributing line is 3 feet in) Tj T*
(diameter, and at the time of my visit there were 37 miles of main, the) Tj T*
