(bonus alluded to and the cost of the expert services which alone) Tj T*
(produced this result.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Use of Bonuses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is proper to say a word here on the subject of bonus as a means of) Tj T*
(increasing efficiency. The principal merit of this motive lies in the) Tj T*
(fact that immediate personal gain is the strongest incentive to) Tj T*
(immediate personal effort. It operates just as strongly on the employe) Tj T*
(as on the employer. Hope of promotion is too vague and the actual) Tj T*
(chances too limited to exert much pressure, but an extra sum in the) Tj T*
(pay envelope--or better still, in a separate one--for the disposal of) Tj T*
(the ?old man himself,? will do wonders. To be most effectual a bonus) Tj T*
(must not begin at the point of standard efficiency, but at the point) Tj T*
(when average efficiency ceases and extra effort begins; and it should) Tj T*
(increase on a curve faster and faster as the point of standard) Tj T*
(efficiency is neared, because the accompanying effort will be) Tj T*
(correspondingly greater.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Efficiency Methods and Department Heads.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
