(foreman up to and including the highest official the same methods can) Tj T*
(and should be applied. Under ordinary circumstances, the workman in) Tj T*
(need of material, tools or instruction keeps his skirts clear by a) Tj T*
(more or less indefinite and unintelligible request to the foreman. He) Tj T*
(thinks it the foreman?s duty to look after him, but that if he does) Tj T*
(not do so it?s no business of his. Put that man on standard time and) Tj T*
