(discovering possible errors or difficulties, and of correcting or) Tj T*
(overcoming them before large expense for material and workmanship has) Tj T*
(been incurred, are too well realized to need more than a simple) Tj T*
(statement for their acceptance. No sane executive would expect his) Tj T*
(department heads to take a copy of his customer?s order and) Tj T*
(individually work out the details with which they are particularly) Tj T*
(concerned and expect the parts to fit. Yet this is just exactly what) Tj T*
