(and unavoidable result.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What Can Be Done.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is perfectly possible, but only to one trained in the particular) Tj T*
(art, to schedule the different operations on all of the different) Tj T*
(parts of the product; to plot the productive times required, so that) Tj T*
(each may begin at such a time in relation to the others that all will) Tj T*
(arrive at the point of assembly at the proper time and in the proper) Tj T*
(sequence; to combine these studies of the different productive orders) Tj T*
(on a chart which will show the disposition to be made of all the men) Tj T*
(and machinery; to prepare advance programs for each man and machine) Tj T*
(engaged in productive labor; and thus to give to the superintendent) Tj T*
(and foremen the advantage of the same predisposition of time that they) Tj T*
(now have of material.) Tj T*
