(Responsibility of the Management.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the opinion of those whose opportunities have enabled them to get) Tj T*
(at the facts, the inefficiency in manufacturing, which undoubtedly) Tj T*
(generally exists today, in spite of the prevailing impression to the) Tj T*
(contrary, is only about one-fourth due to the things over which the) Tj T*
(employes have control and three-fourths to conditions imposed upon) Tj T*
(them by the management. The methods outlined above have achieved) Tj T*
(results whenever they have been faithfully and honestly tried, with) Tj T*
(proper co-operation by the management and under the direction of) Tj T*
(skilled specialists, and the results have continued and will continue) Tj T*
